ude Castle Siege and a good old  Skirmish our plan is to break into the  opponent's stronghold and destroy their  core various roles have been confirmed  from Warrior cleric and Mage each one  with their own unique abilities the PC  version is here it's ready it releases  on January 24th but the console version  has been delayed and will arrive in  April I'll be sure to tell you about it  again nearer the time but if you have a  PC you can do it this month I really  like the look of warlander  okay back to priced games in fact  reduced priced games a brand new  SpongeBob game is here SpongeBob  SquarePants The Cosmic shake after the  success of the Battle for Bikini Bottom  remaster a few years ago a new new story  was commissioned the mechanics remain  mainly unchanged as the action  platformer we know but notably there are  new skills to master like the fishhook  swing for traversal and the karate kick  for combat SpongeBob SquarePants The  Cosmic Shake hits PS4 switch PC and Xbox  One on January 31st Monster Hunter rise  a former switch exclusive finally comes  to PlayStation and Xbox on January 20th  I'm sure you know about monster hunter  games but if not they're exactly what  they say on the tin traversing into a  small open world like region and  locating a beast to be hunted it's then  a systematic and long-winded battle to  either capture or kill them we then  create new armor sets and new Weaponry  from their bones and scales and then we  go back in and do it all over again rise  introduces a new animal companion as  well as rideable beasts to get around  the world a little quicker which makes  you look like a total badass Monster  Hunter rise also has new DLC coming very  soon so there we have it January the  slow month of the year is pretty good  this time around any thing you're  playing I'm gonna try cart Rider drift  and probably Dead Space idle Diapers at  the ready I'm Adam you're awesome all  the best for 2023 I'll see you next time  [Music]

